      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think all common_kernel() should have pahole\u003dselect({}) set, in this change.\n\nThen, please cherry-pick this change to android17-6.18; this will allow --pahole_from_sources be used in android17-6.18 if someone wants to.\n\nThen we wait until we fork away main-kernel-2026 (i.e. we cut the automerger), which likely happens during KMI freeze (soon).\n\nThen, we flip the flag on main-kernel. Because main-kernel-2026 no longer receives changes from main-kernel, android17-6.18 will have --pahole_from_sources\u003dfalse, which is the old behavior, right?",
